    align:applicabilityCondition "Inspect approved standards and their domain relevance, then validate actual data and metadata against the applicable community specifications. Strategy approval alone does not demonstrate conformance." ;
    align:derivedFromSourceNode <https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#contribution/BigDataDataScience/row-2/indirect/R1.3> ;
