    align:rationale "Indirect support: Operations, availability and change management can sustain FAIR infrastructure where the relevant services are commissioned. Acquisition procedures can capture origin (R1.2) and establish release rights (R1.1), but neither is specified by the externally sourced data deliverable." ;
