    align:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    align:sourcePosition 11 ;
    align:sourceText "Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable, responsible/approving roles and dated operating or review records for this activity. No directly supported FAIR requirement is established. To demonstrate FAIR fulfilment, separately test identified data and metadata against the specific requirements commissioned through this process." .

