    align:sourceText "Define Data Security Standards (P)  \\[source: DataSecurityManagement!A4:F4\\] — Deliverable: Data Security Standards.; No clear FAIR support identified from the supplied activity and deliverable. This item can enable implementation, but it does not specify a defensible resource-level FAIR mechanism. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

