    align:fieldHeading "Indirect support" ;
    align:sourcePosition 10 ;
    align:sourceText "Indirect support: Security governance and classification can determine legitimate access conditions and oversee their operation. Security controls must be incorporated into the retrieval protocol to fulfil A1.2; source confidentiality does not imply a FAIR accessibility result." .

align:ACT-05-004-field-11 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:SourceField ;
    rdfs:label "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement"@en ;
    dcterms:source <file:///D:/Work-Documents/13_Research/2026_Research/FAIR/research-repos/FAIR-DAMA-FAIRMM/sources/2026-11-16/DAMA_Segments_High_Level_v1.18.0.md#L1174> ;
    align:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    align:sourcePosition 11 ;
    align:sourceText "A1.2: Test retrieval of identified data and metadata through the declared protocol with authorised, unauthorised and unauthenticated requests. Verify the documented authentication/authorisation procedure and expected decisions; unrestricted public access is not required.; Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable and its approval/maintenance records separately from the resource tests." .

