    rdfs:label "How they can support FAIR"@en ;
    dcterms:source <file:///D:/Work-Documents/13_Research/2026_Research/FAIR/research-repos/FAIR-DAMA-FAIRMM/sources/2026-11-16/DAMA_Segments_High_Level_v1.18.0.md#L1177> ;
    align:fieldHeading "How they can support FAIR" ;
    align:sourcePosition 9 ;
    align:sourceText "Monitor User Authentication and Access Behavior (C) \\[source: DataSecurityManagement!A8:F8\\] — Deliverable: Data Access Logs, Security Notification Alerts, Data Security Reports.; Inferred support: authentication monitoring and access logs can verify access decisions when applied within a data/metadata retrieval protocol. Generic database security, credential management or access monitoring alone does not establish A1.2. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

