    align:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    align:sourcePosition 11 ;
    align:sourceText "F2: Inspect representative metadata linked to the described data; validate descriptive fields against a discovery profile covering meaning, scope, creator, temporal coverage and intended use as applicable. A requirements document or tool inventory alone is insufficient.; F4: Search the deployed index/catalogue using several attributes and confirm representative data/metadata records are registered and returned. Database tuning indexes and a repository without search do not establish F4.; Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable and its approval/maintenance records separately from the resource tests." .

