    align:fieldHeading "Indirect support" ;
    align:sourcePosition 10 ;
    align:sourceText "Indirect support: Metadata ownership, maintenance and standards can sustain resource coverage, descriptive quality and consistent changes. Specify the data identifier explicitly in metadata for F3 and metadata survival for A2; these requirements are absent from the activity labels." .

align:ACT-09-008-field-11 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:SourceField ;
    rdfs:label "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement"@en ;
    dcterms:source <file:///D:/Work-Documents/13_Research/2026_Research/FAIR/research-repos/FAIR-DAMA-FAIRMM/sources/2026-11-16/DAMA_Segments_High_Level_v1.18.0.md#L1726> ;
    align:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    align:sourcePosition 11 ;
    align:sourceText "A1: Starting with an identifier, retrieve representative data and metadata through a documented standard communications protocol; test each separately, including permitted restricted access. A portal, distribution process or accessible database alone is insufficient.; Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable and its approval/maintenance records separately from the resource tests." .

