    align:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    align:sourcePosition 11 ;
    align:sourceText "Test permitted and denied subscription/access requests and the authentication/authorization procedure. For A1 and I1, inspect identifier-based retrieval and the actual shared knowledge-representation language." .

