    align:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    align:sourcePosition 11 ;
    align:sourceText "Inspect approved standards and their domain relevance, then validate actual data and metadata against the applicable community specifications. Strategy approval alone does not demonstrate conformance." .

