    align:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    align:sourcePosition 11 ;
    align:sourceText "Test standardized retrieval of identified resources and inspect version-linked deployment and execution provenance. Monitoring predictive accuracy or infrastructure utilization alone is insufficient." .

