    align:sourceText "Establishing Metrics and methodologies to measure these outcomes reinforces the strategy's connection to essential tools. Importantly, the organization comprehends the impact of FAIRness on its financial performance, prioritizing it as a part of its overarching business strategy, supported by empirical cost-benefit analyses." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D3-L5 .

