    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L3 .

align:evidence-7345804023b740cf76dd87e0 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L124> ;
    align:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L124> ;
    align:rationale "The named deliverable may address the D4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    align:sourceText "Key roles are in place for metadata, data and governance management. The additional personas  that emerged more clearly -or are more clearly part of the FAIR enablers - include [Citizen_Data_Scientist](FAIR_personas/Citizen_Data_Scientist.md) , [Ontologist](FAIR_personas/Ontologist.md), [Master_Data_Manager](FAIR_personas/Master_Data_Manager.md), [Data_Owner](FAIR_personas/Data_Owner.md) , [Data_Strategy_Owner](FAIR_personas/Data_Strategy_Owner.md)and **Data product owner**." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D4-L4 ;
    align:supportsInterpretation align:interpretation-c090c0fd0e5e5f7cf786dae6 .

align:evidence-74dcd4149c9a867b113a63e5 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L186> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "Established processes for producing and managing FAIR data" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L186> ;
    align:sourceText "Established processes for producing and managing FAIR data, with tools, either internally developed or available by vendors and other organizations, could be limited in terms of entities and the level of sophistication." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L3 .

align:evidence-79a73ca0ba78a230bcdb0f0b a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L158> ;
    align:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L158> ;
    align:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F1 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    align:sourceText "The FAIR data training is part of employee onboarding and continuous education development. The organization tailors specific FAIR processes to suit its needs and incorporates guidelines for providing FAIR data into standard IT procedures. Efforts to make metadata implementation accessible in a standardized manner without changing existing processes. The organization begins to integrate FAIR practices into workflows and configure systems to facilitate FAIR practices, demonstrating a commitment to normalising FAIR standards within organizational operations." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D5-L3 ;
    align:supportsInterpretation align:interpretation-810e2fd29c7a50996759bfe2 .

align:evidence-835d8dd91a6a54b638588189 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L188> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "Defined Interaction mechanisms with FAIR data have been consistently implemented" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L188> ;
    align:sourceText "**Defined Interaction Mechanisms:** Defined Interaction mechanisms with FAIR data have been consistently implemented across the organization and meet prioritized, organization-specific business needs." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L4 .

align:evidence-89b9cf56b85a80d7bcd54abf a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L170> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "validating instance metadata against annotation requirements and data shapes" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L170> ;
    align:sourceText "Knowledge about validating instance metadata against annotation requirements and data shapes is evident." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D6-L4 .

align:evidence-8b90e1c9a44b0efcb73841cf a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L158> ;
    align:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level3.md#L158> ;
    align:rationale "The named deliverable may address the F1 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    align:sourceText "The organization initiates formal training for FAIR roles while a majority have embraced FAIR principles for major resources, backed by well-trained personnel capable of evaluating and implementing FAIR standards. At least one business unit actively employs FAIR processes in production, supported by documentation and training, with other FAIR initiatives underway and coordinated efforts recognized." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D5-L3 ;
    align:supportsInterpretation align:interpretation-810e2fd29c7a50996759bfe2 .

align:evidence-8db4ac78f6b9071673b78a36 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L138> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "seamless FAIR data exchange among entities" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L138> ;
    align:sourceText "World-class training programs are established and disseminated through courses. Organizations employ adaptable FAIR data frameworks that provide common standards, facilitating seamless FAIR data exchange among entities via fit-for-purpose FAIR-enabled APIs or tools." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D5-L5 .

align:evidence-8f741afba8a07e2d0d8522c8 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L138> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "Mechanisms exist to sustain metadata across organizations" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L138> ;
    align:sourceText "The organization actively shares its learnings internally and externally, among others, through communities of practices. Processes are in a position to align data harmonisation efforts beyond the organization, such as feedback loops with standard-setting bodies. Mechanisms exist to sustain metadata across organizations, including update and feedback processes between data vendors and consumers." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D5-L5 .

align:evidence-933602b45d65baba5cd6097f a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L183> ;
    align:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L183> ;
    align:rationale "The named deliverable may address the R1.3 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    align:sourceText "Initial infrastructure and tooling are in place for the first working POCs. Now that POCs work and prove value, RFPs or company-wide plans for tooling and infrastructure are getting scoped, including additional capacity for putting that infrastructure and tooling in place (people and budget)." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L2 ;
    align:supportsInterpretation align:interpretation-3fd7c849dc1329db0613751c .

align:evidence-a5b2aa913927fee11d5f6dbe a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L140> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "integrated proof-of-concept projects" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L140> ;
    align:sourceText "Efforts toward aligning individual FAIR data processes are underway but still need to be standardized, with ongoing coordination and integrated proof-of-concept projects in development." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D5-L2 .

align:evidence-aa0cc825da580b4406b22537 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L124> ;
    align:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L124> ;
    align:rationale "The named deliverable may address the D4 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    align:sourceText "Leadership personas ([Business Leaders](), [Business Owner](FAIR_personas/Business_Owner.md) and [Technology_Leader](FAIR_personas/Technology_Leader.md).) keep playing a key role and enables a data-centric enterprise, but all employees are involved implicitly (cf [FAIR tools at level 4](level4.md#level-4-really-fair-fair-tools-and-infrastructures)) or explicitly in the FAIR data principle implementation." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D4-L4 ;
    align:supportsInterpretation align:interpretation-c090c0fd0e5e5f7cf786dae6 .

align:evidence-b3c39a876811c70c96d9b8e9 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L68> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "cross-domain data or industry model" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L68> ;
    align:sourceText "In addition to the level of [Pretty FAIR](level3.md), Data is described in a cross-domain data or industry model." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D1-L4 .

align:evidence-b4b18569fd1764fee069fc1b a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L188> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "periodically evaluates historical and current solutions" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L188> ;
    align:sourceText "**Registry of FAIRification Tools**: Establishing a registry of tools specific to the organization's industry specialization. These tools are applied during the design phase before implementation and company-level processes are in place. Standards and governance practices integrate these tools, and a list of tools or internal experts with an overview of their capability is available. The organization periodically evaluates historical and current solutions, ensuring they remain current and effective." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L4 .

align:evidence-dd033f7244b7b39928791ea3 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L65> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "Controls on access at the system level" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L65> ;
    align:sourceText "Controls on access at the system level." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D1-L2 .

align:evidence-de212cf74cc90bd6fcaaf98d a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L67> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "knowledge language or ontology" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L67> ;
    align:sourceText "In addition to the features described in [Really FAIR](level4.md), we fully describe the data using a knowledge language or ontology of the types that carry GUPRIs (Role: [Knowledge-Enabled Citizens](FAIR_personas/Knowledge-Enabled_Citizen.md) )." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D1-L5 .

align:evidence-ebe9cafc1871894efac1c081 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L183> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "assigning PIDs to key documents" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L183> ;
    align:sourceText "Configure existing systems to implement FAIR, e.g., assigning PIDs to key documents, persons in organizational structures dealing with Human Resource, grant management, and publishing (authoring)." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L2 .

align:evidence-f18ab9855f1d2c782eaa0439 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L173> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "Authentication and Authorization Infrastructure" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L173> ;
    align:sourceText "**Authentication and Authorization Infrastructure (AAI):** This ensures permissible accessibility for individuals and machines, aligning with industry standards." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L5 .

align:evidence-f32f47627c7c6308706a0088 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L183> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "Tools to work with controlled vocabularies" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level2.md#L183> ;
    align:sourceText "At this stage, the following are likely to be implemented (at least in some departments, do not need to be company-wide):Tools introduced to capture and publish metadata; Tools to work with controlled vocabularies; Tools to work with / manage persistent identifiers (PIDs)." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D7-L2 .

align:evidence-f5ef37fb534ebf3ab456e92f a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L170> ;
    align:matchLimitation "Thematic documentary support only. Remaining descriptor clauses, deployment scope and operational capability are not established." ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level4.md#L170> ;
    align:rationale "The named deliverable may address the D6 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    align:sourceText "An organization-wide cross-domain FAIR community of practice is established, with a named leader and regular cadence of meetings with a standing agenda of project reviews, best practice development, real-world experiences, and sharing of learnings." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D6-L4 ;
    align:supportsInterpretation align:interpretation-2deed418accc041fb069a38a .

align:evidence-f713c63ad9c9f860f1eb56e2 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        align:DescriptorEvidence ;
    dcterms:source <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L67> ;
    align:matchingPhrase "new data generated is \"FAIR by design\"" ;
    align:primarySource <https://github.com/Pistoia-Alliance-Inc/FAIR-Maturity-Matrix/blob/8ff4676eb340b0da5034ffb3d0e901c594c3cfc4/docs/level5.md#L67> ;
    align:sourceText "FAIR data are a key strategic asset and advantage of the company. Based on expected business value, critical data assets comply with the FAIR data principle, and new data generated is \"FAIR by design\"." ;
    align:supportedByDescriptor align:D1-L5 .

