    align:rationale "Define Data Security Controls and Procedures (D) \\[source: DataSecurityManagement!A5:F5\\] — Deliverable: Data Security Controls and Procedures.; Inferred support: Data Security Controls and Procedures can define access checks when applied within a data/metadata retrieval protocol. Generic database security, credential management or access monitoring alone does not establish A1.2. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
