    align:rationale "Define and Maintain the Metadata Architecture (P)  \\[source: DataArchitectureManagement!A9:F9\\] — Deliverable: Metadata Architecture.; Inferred support: metadata architecture can select a shared formal representation; the source does not name the language or deployed records. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    align:sourceCoordinate "DataArchitectureManagement!A9:L9" ;
    align:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    align:targetsPrinciple fair:I1 .

