    align:rationale "Manage Data Model Versioning and Integration (C)  \\[source: DataDevelopment!A12:F12\\] — Deliverable: Model Management Libraries and Contents.; Explicit partial support: model management libraries and versioning can record the provenance of model artefacts if these are in the FAIR scope. Version records must be associated with released model data/metadata; versioning alone is incomplete provenance. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    align:sourceCoordinate "DataModelingDesign!A12:L12" ;
    align:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    align:targetsPrinciple fair:R1.2 .

