    align:rationale "The named deliverable may address the D2 aspect of these clauses when its applicability condition is met." ;
    align:sourceText "More \"buy-in\" is happening: leadership-funded initiatives, commitment to enabling key steps, and Memberships to enabling organizations (e.g. for PIDs )." ;
